  m_text: 'Be gentle with the controls at first. It also helps to get used to the
    individual controls before combining them.


    You can hover by slowing the
    helicopter down and throttling down until you reach the throttle constant, the
    value in between descending and ascending.


    Feel free to try certain controls
    here.

    Or, head out into the world. The choice

    is yours!'
